      "content": "hey so i've been feeling kinda low and moody lately and i really want to try something more natural for my mental health instead of more meds. i've heard st johns wort is really good for that... is it okay to take that alongside the birth control pill i'm on? i don't want to mess anything up but i really want to try it}",
